-- Replace the generated catalog sentences with short product descriptions.
--
-- The old sentence listed every flavor, size or color, or ended with
-- "from the … line in our … department." Flavors stay on the variant list.
-- Each update runs only while the row still has that old sentence, so an
-- edit made in Admin is left alone. Running the file again changes nothing.
-- The old sentence in the WHERE clause is the reverse.

